WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Start with your workspace invitation. Check the organization, workspace, email and role. This fictional invitation grants access to one workspace only.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Use the invited email address. Join with a supported provider or a password. Provider sign-in is disabled on this demonstration site.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Sign in with your existing account. Existing members use their current sign-in method. This walkthrough does not accept the fictional invitation.

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:23.000
An existing demo owner signs in. The next view uses the shared demo account. No new account or membership was created in this video.

5
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Confirm the workspace before opening records. Use the workspace profile to check your organization, workspace and environment. Membership determines access.
